\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces A fundamental set for the index-twelve monodromy kernel in the real parabolic stabilizer of $d$. The base is a modular fundamental set with its rotation coordinate; the fibre is the indicated Heisenberg parallelepiped. The displayed face maps include the central shears. The representative map and the boundary identifications are proved in \ref {I:monodromy-fundamental-set}; the index twelve occurs in the central fibre coordinate.}}{84}{figure.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:I:monodromy-domain}{{4}{84}{A fundamental set for the index-twelve monodromy kernel in the real parabolic stabilizer of $d$. The base is a modular fundamental set with its rotation coordinate; the fibre is the indicated Heisenberg parallelepiped. The displayed face maps include the central shears. The representative map and the boundary identifications are proved in \ref {I:monodromy-fundamental-set}; the index twelve occurs in the central fibre coordinate}{figure.4}{}}
